# Dependency changes → documentation

When editing matched dependency paths:

1. Follow [docs/DOC-MAP.md](../../docs/DOC-MAP.md) **Dependency feature implementation checklist**.
2. If shipping a roadmap item: strike through in [docs/roadmap/dependency-expansion.md](../../docs/roadmap/dependency-expansion.md), append [docs/history/changelog.md](../../docs/history/changelog.md), update [docs/roadmap/active.md](../../docs/roadmap/active.md), and [README.md](../../README.md) when users gain a new mechanic or flag.
3. Invoke **`/ship-dependency-feature`** before finishing the task.

Do not merge dependency code without the corresponding doc updates in the same PR.
